{"synopsis":"Kehidupan pertama Setelah kecelakaan tragis dan kehilangan keluarga dan dia juga kehilangam kakinya ia mengakhiri hidupnya sendiri\nLalu di Kehidupan kedua Dia mendapatkan ketenaran sebagai Master Setan Merah di Zhongyuan tetapi dikhianati oleh orang yang paling dia percayai\nDan sekarang tiba di kehidupan ketiganya Dalam kehidupannya di dunia modern Gang Jinho memutuskan untuk hidup normal \nNamun ia terlalu terbiasa dengan kehidupan Zhongyuan untuk menjadi orang barbar\nAku ingin hidup dengan damai Tapi kaulah yang memulainya Saya harap Anda siap untuk ini\nDi depan ancaman kehidupan barunya bisakah Gang Jinho melepaskan dorongan hatinya sebagai Master Setan Merah dan mendapatkan kehidupan normal yang diinginkannya\nKisah adaptasi seorang seniman bela diri legendaris di abad ke21","alternative_title":"마존현세강림기","author":"AZI, Wolbaek","artist":"Mayorang","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"427a4642-d1b0-44ba-82bb-386ef4721b8b","number":"168","chapter":"168","title":"Chapter 168","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"168591f6-3621-4243-80a7-b3c4cfac0540","number":"167","chapter":"167","title":"Chapter 167","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"552cd93a-c2ad-405a-ae9f-420c9d657b0d","number":"166","chapter":"166","title":"Chapter 166","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"56bd4404-4b90-4ef9-ba80-acb9253fd57d","number":"165","chapter":"165","title":"Chapter 165","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9c4b287a-d85d-47e8-82ad-5133df5472b6","number":"164","chapter":"164","title":"Chapter 164","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bef13c92-b974-453e-85b4-dd87b5b2f943","number":"163","chapter":"163","title":"Chapter 163","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"476fe435-c370-47ed-bc71-d72dcb1eab1a","number":"162","chapter":"162","title":"Chapter 162","date":"2024-12-02","re